{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51842","headline":"战城南 · 无名氏","name":"战城南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"战地何昏昏，战士如羣蚁。\n气重日轮红，血染蓬蒿紫。\n乌鸟衔人肉，食闷飞不起。\n昨日城上人，今日城下鬼。\n旗色如罗星，鼙声殊未已。\n妾家夫与儿，俱在鼙声里。\n（《文苑英华》一九六《乐府》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}